<title>UK: British Energy plans one bln stg bid-paper.</title>
<headline>British Energy plans one bln stg bid-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Energy, the nuclear power company, is planning its first acquisition since last year's privatisation, the Sunday Telegraph reported.</p>
<p>The newspaper said the company is to join a consortium to launch a one billion stg bid for Australian power station Loy Yang A in Victoria.</p>
<p>British Energy is expected to be a partner in one of the three consortia bidding for the station, the third to be privatised by the state, the Sunday Telegraph said.</p>
